#. ………………
msgctxt "0001 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ………………
msgctxt "0002 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>腐川さん、ずっとボクの前に立ってるけど、
#. 何か用なのかな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>She's just standing there. Does she want something...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0004 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>でも、何も喋らないし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But she's not saying anything...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0006 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>むしろ、こっちから、
#. 話題を振ってあげた方がいいのかな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Maybe I should try to start a conversation...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あのさ…腐川さん…？
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "U-Um, Toko...?"
msgstr ""

#. 何よ？　あたしと話したいの？
#. し、仕方ないわね…！　話しなさいよ！
msgctxt "0009 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"What? You wanna t-talk to me? Well, I can't stop\n"
"y-you. So talk already!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、話題を振るって言っても…
#. えーっと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Okay, sure, but...what should I say?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …あのさ、腐川さんってさ、
#. 普段は何をしてるの？
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "So, uh, what do you like to do in your spare time?"
msgstr ""

#. な、なんで…そんな事聞くの…？
msgctxt "0012 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Why do you w-wanna know...?"
msgstr ""

#. いや…なんでって言うか…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Well, I mean, you know..."
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に閉じ込められた<CLT 3>“仲間”<CLT>だし、
#. お互いの事を色々と知っておいた方がいいかなって…
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"We're trapped here together, right? If we're gonna be\n"
"<CLT 3>friends<CLT>, it'd be nice to get to know each other."
msgstr ""

#. …え？　なんて言った？
msgctxt "0015 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Huh? What'd you just s-say?"
msgstr ""

#. は…？
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Um..."
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に閉じ込められた…なんて言った？
msgctxt "0017 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"After that p-part about being trapped...\n"
"We're gonna be wh-what?"
msgstr ""

#. 仲間…
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Uh...friends?"
msgstr ""

#. うふ…うふふふ…
msgctxt "0019 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Hmmmeeheheheeh..."
msgstr ""

#. な、何が仲間よ…そんな言葉で騙そうたって…
#. そうはいかないわよ…！
msgctxt "0020 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Whaddya mean, f-friends!? You think I'm s-stupid?\n"
"You're trying to trick me!"
msgstr ""

#. 前に…それで痛い目に遭った事だってあるのよ…
#. だ、だから…もう騙されないわよ…！
msgctxt "0021 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I've already been h-hurt once before... I'm not gonna\n"
"l-let it happen again...!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それで痛い目って…何があったんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You've been hurt? What happened...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そ、そもそも…あたしの事を知りたいなんて…
#. 口から出まかせでしょ？
msgctxt "0023 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Come on, y-you don't really care about m-me..."
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうせ、あたしになんか興味ないのよ！
#. それくらい…わ、わかってるわよ！！
msgctxt "0024 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You don't want to kn-know about me! Even I know\n"
"that...!"
msgstr ""

#. い、いや…そんな事は…
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "N-No, that's not true...!"
msgstr ""

#. だ、だったら答えてみなさいよ…
msgctxt "0026 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Fine. Then t-tell me..."
msgstr ""

#. …何を？
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Tell you what?"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あたしが<CLT 3>“超高校級の文学少女”<CLT>って事は…
#. さすがに…知ってるわよね…？
msgctxt "0028 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"You know why they c-call me the <CLT 3>Ultimate Writing\n"
"Prodigy<CLT>, right?"
msgstr ""

#. うん、もちろん…
#. 文学賞だって、たくさん受賞してるって…
msgctxt "0029 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Yeah, sure. You've won all kinds of literature prizes\n"
"and stuff."
msgstr ""

#. あたしが得意とする<CLT 3>小説のジャンル<CLT>…
#. それを答えてみなさいよ…！
msgctxt "0030 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Then tell me wh-what I'm good at... Tell m-me what my\n"
"<CLT 3>genre specialty<CLT> is!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、あたしに興味あるって言うなら…
#. 答えられるはずよ！
msgctxt "0031 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"If you r-really wanna convince me you give a crap, you\n"
"should at least kn-know that...!"
msgstr ""

#. 恋愛小説
msgctxt "0032 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Romance"
msgstr ""

#. ノンフィクション
msgctxt "0033 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Non-fiction"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ノンフィクション…だったっけ…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's non-fiction, right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、違うな。
#. “超高校級の文学少女”って言うくらいだし…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Wait, that can't be right. I don't think you need to\n"
"be a \"writing prodigy\" for that kinda thing.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なに？
#. ほら、早く言ってみなさいよ…！
msgctxt "0036 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "C'mon, if you r-really know, hurry up and say it...!"
msgstr ""

#. ええっと…
msgctxt "0037 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Umm..."
msgstr ""

#. ライトノベル
msgctxt "0038 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Young adult"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ライトノベル…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0039 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Young adult?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ではなかったよな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0040 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, that's not it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …ちょっと。
#. 今…ロクでもない事を考えてなかった…？
msgctxt "0041 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"H-Hey...! Were you just thinking some w-worthless\n"
"thought?"
msgstr ""

#. えっ…
msgctxt "0042 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. い、いつまで待たせるのよ…
#. さっさと答えなさい…！
msgctxt "0043 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"How long are you gonna m-make me wait? Answer\n"
"already...!"
msgstr ""

#. ほ…ほら見なさい…
#. 答えられないじゃない…！
msgctxt "0044 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "S-See? You don't know!"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱり、あたしになんか興味ないんでしょ！？
msgctxt "0045 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "You don't care about me at a-all!"
msgstr ""

#. そんなことないよ！
#. ちゃんと答えられるってば！
msgctxt "0046 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "That's not true! I do know the answer!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>“超高校級の文学少女”腐川さんが得意とする
#. 小説のジャンルは…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The genre that the Ultimate Writing Prodigy\n"
"specializes in...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 恋愛小説…だよね？
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "It's romance, of course."
msgstr ""

#. あ、あら…答えられた…？
msgctxt "0049 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Oh...you a-actually knew?"
msgstr ""

#. 『磯の香りの消えぬ間に』は、
#. 腐川さんの代表作ともいえる恋愛小説で…
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Your biggest success was \"So Lingers the Ocean,\"\n"
"right? Everyone says it's your masterpiece."
msgstr ""

#. 影響を受けた若い女性の間で漁師が大人気になるなど、
#. 社会現象を生み出す大ヒットとなった…でしょ？
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The book was such a hit that fishermen shot to\n"
"the top of all the \"Hottest Men\" polls...right?"
msgstr ""

#. ど、どうして覚えていられるの？
msgctxt "0052 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "How did y-you know all that...?"
msgstr ""

#. だって…あたしの事なんて…
#. なんの興味もないはずなのに…！
msgctxt "0053 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "There's no way you c-care about me...!"
msgstr ""

#. だから、興味ない事ないって。
#. だって、ボク達は仲間なんだよ？
msgctxt "0054 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"I'm telling you, I do! I mean, we're friends,\n"
"aren't we?"
msgstr ""

#. ううっ！　眩しいわ！
#. あんたの真っ直ぐさが眩しいわ…！
msgctxt "0055 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Nng...! I'm blind! Your s-straightforward nature\n"
"blinded me!"
msgstr ""

#. ひぃぃぃぃぃ…！
msgctxt "0056 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Hyeeeeeeeehhh!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>妙な奇声を発しながら、
#. 腐川さんは走って逃げて行った…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Toko ran off, screaming like a banshee.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. なんだか、よくわからないけど…
#. 嫌われたっぽいな…
msgctxt "0058 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I'm not really sure... Does she hate me now?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>腐川冬子の<CLT><CLT 3>通信簿<CLT><CLT 23>に、今の情報を追記致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0059 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Toko's <CLT><CLT 3>Report Card<CLT><CLT 23> has been updated based on your\n"
"experience with her.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>おめでとうございます。
#. スキル<CLT><CLT 3>“ボキャブラリー”<CLT><CLT 23>を獲得致しました。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0060 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>You just unlocked the skill <CLT><CLT 3>Vocabulary<CLT><CLT 23>!\n"
"Give yourself a pat on the back. You've earned it!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>腐川さんと別れた後、
#. ボクは、いったん自分の部屋へと戻った。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Once we were all done, I headed back to my room for a\n"
"little while...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
